nyone they were watching it  yeah it really um it's empowering to be  here today  i i believe it i i don't know you and i  am proud of you for making this come to  to the world because i feel like it is  going to  just be so powerful for people because  listen the other  versions of queer spoke we all know were  very white um and very one thing and to  now in 2022 have a version of queer  spoke that is reflective of the real  queer community that is out there there  are kids out there who are going to sit  down  and maybe do the same thing that we did  as children and put this on and flip the  channel but they won't feel as alone and  that really is incredible  absolutely and my hope is actually that  now we're in a time hopefully when maybe  we can leave that last channel button  out of the equation and that people can  actually not watch it with the volume  turn down mute on mute but like maybe  turn it all the way up yeah like that is  my that is my hope but obviously not  everyone you know not everyone has that  that luxury but that is the hope is that  you know we're we have  i think a very you know it was very  important for me for the show to be  inclusive to um not overlook obviously  we can't represent it we have eight  episodes  we cannot represent every single person  that's not gonna happen not in its first  season at least  um but you know it was very important  for me to make sure that we use this  title to make sure that other members of  our community feel welcomed and included  in this new iteration chapter of the  show  i just spoke to johnny and devin who are  so incredible in this show like they are  so perfectly casted how did you know  when you found your brody  actually i think we did a chemistry read  with uh with noah  with um johnny and devon together and it  really clicked at that point um but it  was um you know we searched far and wide  all over the world for these  for this incredible cast  and um yeah devin just stormed through  the do